WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.059
- My name is Kelly,

00:00:01.059 --> 00:00:03.432
and I cheated on my partner
about eight years ago.

00:00:03.432 --> 00:00:05.840
(lighthearted music)

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.840
I was about 23, 24 and
had been with this person

00:00:10.589 --> 00:00:12.626
for about three years at the time.

00:00:12.626 --> 00:00:15.644
We hadn't been intimate in
about five to six months

00:00:15.644 --> 00:00:19.906
and a friend of mine invited
me to Pride, in Atlanta.

00:00:19.906 --> 00:00:23.157
There was an all girl party
and this girl was there,

00:00:23.157 --> 00:00:24.082
and she was hitting on me.

00:00:24.082 --> 00:00:25.411
I let her know that night,

00:00:25.411 --> 00:00:27.624
I have a girlfriend and she
was like, "that's fine."

00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:28.662
Like, we could be cool.

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:30.474
So we partied for two nights straight,

00:00:30.474 --> 00:00:33.184
and on the second night,
something came over me,

00:00:33.184 --> 00:00:35.853
and I was just like, you know,
let's take a shower together

00:00:35.853 --> 00:00:37.613
when we get back to the hotel room, like,

00:00:37.613 --> 00:00:39.730
just a shower, like, nothing more.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.541
We got back to the hotel room,

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.248
uh, hopped in the shower,

00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:46.402
and actually nothing happened
while we were in the shower.

00:00:46.402 --> 00:00:49.912
Like it was straight up
like, me washing her down,

00:00:49.912 --> 00:00:52.611
her doing the same, and
like, called it a night.

00:00:52.611 --> 00:00:54.872
So, it was late, and I
was like, ya know what,

00:00:54.872 --> 00:00:58.234
we have a big-ass king sized
bed, ya know, stay the night.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.445
I was laying in the bed,
she was in like, the chaise.

00:01:00.445 --> 00:01:02.485
And we was talkin', and then
like, the sun was comin' up,

00:01:02.485 --> 00:01:03.965
and everything was cool,
and then she was like,

00:01:03.965 --> 00:01:07.101
ya know, "I'm so far from you,
can I like, come over there."

00:01:07.101 --> 00:01:09.768
So I was like, alright, ya know,

00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:12.789
kinda like knowin' I should
say no, but also like,

00:01:12.789 --> 00:01:14.738
I said yes, and I was just like,

00:01:14.738 --> 00:01:17.889
oh god, what am I getting myself into?

00:01:17.889 --> 00:01:19.889
But also, I wanna do it.

00:01:20.209 --> 00:01:21.829
Of course I thought about my partner,

00:01:21.829 --> 00:01:24.848
but instant gratification takes over so,

00:01:24.848 --> 00:01:27.289
I can't even remember if
it was good, it was like,

00:01:27.289 --> 00:01:30.229
mediocre, so like, ya know,
after you cheat you're like,

00:01:30.229 --> 00:01:31.957
oh my god, this wasn't even worth it.

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:36.150
I felt like shit, ya know, we
had been together for like,

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.310
almost three and a half years.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.998
And then a part of me
was just like, I'm human,

00:01:39.998 --> 00:01:42.318
and ya know, this was a part of my desire,

00:01:42.318 --> 00:01:43.151
and I,

00:01:43.751 --> 00:01:44.740
I went for it.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:47.238
I haven't done it since then,
it's really not in my nature.

00:01:47.238 --> 00:01:48.950
But I kind've been just like,

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:52.117
in six month relationships since then.

00:01:52.252 --> 00:01:55.252
Like, nothing really sticks, and so,

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:59.136
I guess that leads me
to the point of maybe,

00:01:59.136 --> 00:02:01.803
I'm not the relationship person.

00:02:02.006 --> 00:02:05.446
No, that I know of, my
partner never found out.

00:02:05.446 --> 00:02:07.649
And we don't communicate today, so.

00:02:07.649 --> 00:02:09.395
I think the reason why people cheat

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.336
is it's a part of human nature.

00:02:11.336 --> 00:02:12.784
Ya know, we're sexual beings.

00:02:12.784 --> 00:02:16.726
Monogamy has kinda been forced
upon us in society, ya know,

00:02:16.726 --> 00:02:18.536
we feel like we have to conform

00:02:18.536 --> 00:02:20.574
to just being with one person.

00:02:20.574 --> 00:02:23.224
To be honest, like, I should
have just left the relationship

00:02:23.224 --> 00:02:25.057
if I wasn't happy, or,

00:02:25.246 --> 00:02:28.835
communicated that to my
partner like, in the moment.

00:02:28.835 --> 00:02:30.794
Maybe a phone call, like hey, ya know,

00:02:30.794 --> 00:02:33.696
there's this girl and I'm
really interested in her.

00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:34.942
Like, what's going on with us.

00:02:34.942 --> 00:02:36.584
I mean, it wouldn't have been ideal,

00:02:36.584 --> 00:02:38.086
but it woulda been honest

00:02:38.086 --> 00:02:41.246
and also, ya know, I was
about 23, 24 at the time.

00:02:41.246 --> 00:02:43.403
I would have handled it
much differently now.

00:02:43.403 --> 00:02:46.486
(lighthearted music)

